---
import GamePage from '../../layouts/GamePage.astro';
---

<GamePage
	title="Rayou et la Fête des Lumières | Jeux Ludiven Studio"
	description="Rayou et la Fête des Lumières : une aventure en 3D pour toute la famille. Aide les amis de la vallée, saute de rocher en rocher, roule en boule sous les obstacles et allume la grande lanterne du Pic. Gratuit, sans pub, sans inscription."
	heading="Rayou et la Fête des Lumières"
	tagline="Une aventure en 3D : aide tes amis de la vallée et allume la lanterne du Pic"
	gameId="rayou"
>
	<div id="ry-root" class="ry-root">
	<div id="ry-stage"><canvas id="ry-view"></canvas></div>
		<div id="ry-fade"></div>
	
		<div class="ry-hud">
			<button id="ry-btn-menu" class="ry-chip-btn" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
			<button id="ry-objective" class="ry-chip" hidden><span id="ry-obj-text"></span><span id="ry-obj-more"></span></button>
			<button id="ry-counters" class="ry-chip" aria-label="Ouvrir le sac">
				<span class="ry-bag-ico" aria-hidden="true">🎒</span>
				<span class="ry-ico ry-jar" aria-hidden="true"></span><b id="ry-jar-count">0/4</b>
				<span class="ry-ico ry-gold" aria-hidden="true"></span><b id="ry-gold-count">0/24</b>
			</button>
			<div id="ry-arrow" hidden><span></span></div>
			<p id="ry-hint" hidden></p>
			<div id="ry-toasts"></div>
	
			<div id="ry-tuto" hidden>
				<div class="ry-tuto-head"><span id="ry-tuto-step"></span><b id="ry-tuto-title"></b><span class="ry-tuto-ok">✓ Bravo !</span></div>
				<p id="ry-tuto-text"></p>
				<div id="ry-tuto-bar"><span></span></div>
				<button id="ry-tuto-skip">Passer le tutoriel</button>
			</div>
	
			<div id="ry-joy"><div id="ry-joy-knob"></div></div>
			<button id="ry-btn-jump" class="ry-touch-btn" aria-label="Sauter">⤒<small>Sauter</small></button>
			<button id="ry-btn-roll" class="ry-touch-btn" aria-label="Rouler">⟳<small>Rouler</small></button>
			<button id="ry-btn-action" class="ry-touch-btn"><span id="ry-action-label"></span></button>
	
			<div id="ry-dialog" hidden>
				<span id="ry-dlg-name"></span>
				<p id="ry-dlg-text"></p>
				<span class="ry-dlg-next">▶</span>
			</div>
	
			<section id="ry-intro" class="ry-card-screen">
				<div class="ry-card">
					<p class="ry-kicker">Aventure · chapitre 1</p>
					<h1>Rayou</h1>
					<p class="ry-sub">et la Fête des Lumières</p>
					<p class="ry-prologue">
						Par une nuit pleine d’étoiles, un bébé tigre est arrivé seul dans la vallée. Les animaux l’ont recueilli et l’ont appelé Rayou.
						Ce matin, c’est le jour de la Fête des Lumières…
					</p>
					<ul class="ry-keys">
						<li class="ry-desk"><b>ZQSD</b> ou flèches : bouger · <b>Espace</b> : sauter · <b>Maj</b> : rouler</li>
						<li class="ry-desk"><b>E</b> : agir · <b>P</b> : menu · glisser la souris : caméra</li>
						<li class="ry-mob">Pouce gauche : bouger · glisser à droite : caméra</li>
					</ul>
					<div class="ry-row">
						<button id="ry-continue" hidden>Continuer</button>
						<button id="ry-play">Nouvelle partie</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
	
			<section id="ry-menu" class="ry-card-screen" hidden>
				<div class="ry-card ry-wide">
					<div class="ry-tabs" role="tablist">
						<button class="ry-tab" data-tab="bag">Sac</button>
						<button class="ry-tab ry-on" data-tab="quests">Objectifs</button>
						<button class="ry-tab" data-tab="controls">Commandes</button>
						<button class="ry-tab" data-tab="map">Carte</button>
						<button class="ry-tab" data-tab="memories">Souvenirs</button>
						<button class="ry-tab" data-tab="options">Options</button>
					</div>
					<div class="ry-pane" data-pane="bag" hidden><ul id="ry-bag"></ul></div>
					<div class="ry-pane" data-pane="quests"><ul id="ry-quest-list"></ul></div>
					<div class="ry-pane" data-pane="controls" hidden>
						<ul class="ry-controls ry-desk">
							<li><span><kbd>Z</kbd><kbd>Q</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd> / flèches</span>Courir</li>
							<li><span><kbd>Espace</kbd></span>Sauter (garder enfoncé : plus haut)</li>
							<li><span><kbd>Maj</kbd> ou <kbd>C</kbd></span>Rouler en boule : passer sous les obstacles bas, casser ce qui est fendu</li>
							<li><span><kbd>Maj</kbd> puis <kbd>Espace</kbd></span>Saut roulé : sauter bien plus loin</li>
							<li><span><kbd>E</kbd> ou <kbd>Entrée</kbd></span>Parler, ramasser, grimper</li>
							<li><span>Glisser la souris</span>Tourner la caméra</li>
							<li><span><kbd>Tab</kbd></span>Changer d’objectif suivi</li>
							<li><span><kbd>P</kbd></span>Menu</li>
						</ul>
						<ul class="ry-controls ry-mob">
							<li><span>Pouce à gauche</span>Courir</li>
							<li><span>Doigt à droite</span>Tourner la caméra</li>
							<li><span><b class="ry-ico-btn">⤒</b></span>Sauter (garder appuyé : plus haut)</li>
							<li><span><b class="ry-ico-btn">⟳</b></span>Rouler en boule : passer sous les obstacles bas, casser ce qui est fendu</li>
							<li><span><b class="ry-ico-btn">⟳</b> puis <b class="ry-ico-btn">⤒</b></span>Saut roulé : sauter bien plus loin</li>
							<li><span><b class="ry-ico-btn ry-yellow">Parler</b></span>Le bouton jaune : parler, ramasser, grimper</li>
							<li><span>Bandeau ★</span>Toucher pour changer d’objectif suivi</li>
						</ul>
						<p class="ry-note">Pas de bobo : une grosse chute se termine en roulade, et un plongeon ramène Rayou au bord.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="ry-pane" data-pane="map" hidden><canvas id="ry-map" width="336" height="268"></canvas></div>
					<div class="ry-pane" data-pane="memories" hidden><ul id="ry-memories"></ul></div>
					<div class="ry-pane" data-pane="options" hidden>
						<div class="ry-opts">
							<button id="ry-opt-tuto">Revoir le tutoriel</button>
							<button id="ry-opt-unstuck">Débloquer Rayou</button>
							<button id="ry-opt-full">Plein écran</button>
							<button id="ry-opt-sfx">Sons : oui</button>
							<button id="ry-opt-music">Musique : oui</button>
							<button id="ry-opt-reset" class="ry-danger">Recommencer du début</button>
						</div>
					</div>
					<button id="ry-resume" class="ry-primary">Reprendre</button>
				</div>
			</section>
	
			<section id="ry-end" class="ry-card-screen" hidden>
				<div class="ry-card">
					<p class="ry-kicker">Fin du chapitre 1</p>
					<h1>À suivre…</h1>
					<p>La lanterne brille sur le Pic, et quelqu’un, de l’autre côté des montagnes, y a répondu.</p>
					<ul class="ry-stats">
						<li>Temps de jeu : <b id="ry-end-time"></b></li>
						<li>Noisettes dorées : <b id="ry-end-gold"></b></li>
						<li>Souvenirs : <b id="ry-end-mem"></b></li>
					</ul>
					<div class="ry-row">
						<button id="ry-end-explore">Continuer à explorer</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
	
			<div id="ry-rotate"><div><span class="ry-phone">📱</span><p>Tourne ton téléphone<br />pour jouer en paysage</p></div></div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<script>
		import { start } from '../../games/rayou/main';
		start();
	</script>
</GamePage>

<style is:global>
	/* The game box: 16:10 in the page, the whole screen in fullscreen. */
	.ry-root {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
		max-width: 1120px;
		max-height: calc(100vh - 2rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
		overflow: hidden;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		background: #f2dcc0;
		isolation: isolate;
		font-family: var(--font-body, system-ui, sans-serif);
		color: #3a2a1c;
		-webkit-user-select: none;
		user-select: none;
		-webkit-touch-callout: none;
		-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
	}

	.game-page.gf-full .ry-root {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		max-height: none;
		aspect-ratio: auto;
		border-radius: 0;
	}

	/* The site's "Quitter" button sits in the top-right corner in fullscreen. */
	/* Touch: the objective sits next to the menu button, clear of the counters on the right. */
	.ry-root.ry-touch #ry-objective {
		left: calc(max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-left)) + 52px);
		transform: none;
		max-width: calc(55% - 70px);
		text-align: left;
	}

	html.gf-full #ry-counters {
		right: calc(var(--gf-exit-w, 100px) + 24px);
	}

	.ry-root button {
		font-family: inherit;
	}

	#ry-stage {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		touch-action: none;
	}

	#ry-view {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
	}

	#ry-fade {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: #fff8ec;
		opacity: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		transition: opacity 0.3s;
	}

	.ry-hud {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		font-family: var(--font-body, system-ui, sans-serif);
		color: #3a2a1c;
	}

	.ry-hud > * {
		pointer-events: auto;
	}

	.ry-chip,
	.ry-chip-btn {
		position: absolute;
		border: none;
		background: rgba(255, 250, 240, 0.92);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(80, 50, 20, 0.18);
		color: inherit;
		font: inherit;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	#ry-btn-menu {
		top: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-top));
		left: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-left));
		width: 42px;
		height: 42px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	#ry-objective {
		top: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-top));
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		max-width: min(60%, 520px);
		padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		text-align: center;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	#ry-objective::before {
		content: '★ ';
		color: #f0a020;
	}

	#ry-obj-more {
		margin-left: 0.4rem;
		color: #a0835f;
		font-size: 0.8em;
	}

	#ry-counters {
		top: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-top));
		right: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.3rem;
		padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.ry-bag-ico {
		margin-right: 0.15rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	#ry-counters b + .ry-ico {
		margin-left: 0.5rem;
	}

	.ry-ico {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 16px;
		height: 18px;
	}

	.ry-ico.ry-jar {
		border-radius: 4px 4px 6px 6px;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 60%, #fff3a0 0 25%, #ffcf3a 45%, rgba(255, 207, 58, 0.25) 75%);
		box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(120, 90, 40, 0.45);
	}

	.ry-ico.ry-gold {
		border-radius: 50% 50% 45% 45%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #fff3b0, #e6a91c 60%, #a8700e);
	}

	#ry-arrow {
		position: absolute;
		width: 34px;
		height: 34px;
		margin: -17px 0 0 -17px;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	#ry-arrow span {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		background: #ffd23f;
		clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 75%, 50% 55%, 0 75%);
		filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 3px rgba(80, 50, 20, 0.5));
	}

	#ry-hint {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 22%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
		border-radius: 0.6rem;
		background: rgba(58, 42, 28, 0.85);
		color: #fff;
		font-weight: 700;
		pointer-events: none;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	#ry-toasts {
		position: absolute;
		top: 64px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.ry-toast {
		padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: rgba(58, 42, 28, 0.88);
		color: #fff;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		animation: toast 3s ease forwards;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.ry-toast.ry-big {
		background: #ffd23f;
		color: #3a2a1c;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	@keyframes toast {
		0% {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: translateY(-8px) scale(0.9);
		}
		10%,
		80% {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: none;
		}
		100% {
			opacity: 0;
		}
	}

	#ry-tuto {
		position: absolute;
		top: calc(max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-top)) + 54px);
		left: max(12px, env(safe-area-inset-left));
		width: min(320px, calc(100% - 24px));
		box-sizing: border-box;
		padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		background: rgba(255, 250, 240, 0.95);
		box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(80, 50, 20, 0.25);
		border: 2px solid #ffd23f;
		transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
	}

	#ry-tuto[hidden] {
		display: none;
	}

	#ry-tuto.ry-done {
		border-color: #4f9e45;
		background: rgba(236, 248, 228, 0.97);
	}

	.ry-tuto-head {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	#ry-tuto-step {
		padding: 0.05rem 0.45rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: #ee8a2c;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	#ry-tuto-title {
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.ry-tuto-ok {
		display: none;
		margin-left: auto;
		color: #3f8a36;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	#ry-tuto.ry-done .ry-tuto-ok {
		display: inline;
	}

	#ry-tuto-text {
		margin: 0.4rem 0 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	#ry-tuto-bar {
		height: 6px;
		border-radius: 3px;
		background: #efe0c8;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	#ry-tuto-bar span {
		display: block;
		height: 100%;
		width: 0;
		background: #4f9e45;
		transition: width 0.2s;
	}

	#ry-tuto-skip {
		margin-top: 0.4rem;
		padding: 0;
		border: none;
		background: none;
		color: #a0835f;
		font: inherit;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-decoration: underline;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.ry-root kbd {
		display: inline-block;
		min-width: 1.3em;
		margin: 0 0.1em;
		padding: 0.05em 0.35em;
		border-radius: 0.3em;
		border: 1px solid #c9b79c;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #c9b79c;
		background: #fff;
		font: inherit;
		font-size: 0.85em;
		font-weight: 800;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.ry-ico-btn {
		display: inline-grid;
		place-items: center;
		min-width: 1.7em;
		height: 1.7em;
		padding: 0 0.2em;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: #fff;
		box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(80, 50, 20, 0.3);
		font-size: 0.9em;
	}

	.ry-ico-btn.ry-yellow {
		background: #ffd23f;
		padding: 0 0.6em;
	}

	@media (pointer: coarse) and (max-height: 500px) {
		#ry-tuto {
			width: min(280px, 40%);
			padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem 0.45rem;
		}
		#ry-tuto-text {
			font-size: 0.8rem;
			margin: 0.3rem 0 0.4rem;
		}
	}

	#ry-joy {
		position: absolute;
		width: 112px;
		height: 112px;
		margin: -56px 0 0 -56px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
		border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
		opacity: 0;
		transition: opacity 0.15s;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	#ry-joy-knob {
		position: absolute;
		left: 28px;
		top: 28px;
		width: 56px;
		height: 56px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
	}

	.ry-touch-btn {
		position: absolute;
		display: none;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 50%;
		font: inherit;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #3a2a1c;
		background: rgba(255, 250, 240, 0.88);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(80, 50, 20, 0.25);
		touch-action: none;
	}

	.ry-touch-btn small {
		position: absolute;
		left: 50%;
		bottom: -1.3em;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		font-size: 0.62rem;
		color: #fff;
		text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.ry-touch-btn.ry-pulse {
		animation: pulse 1.1s ease-in-out infinite;
	}

	@keyframes pulse {
		0%,
		100% {
			box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(255, 210, 63, 0.95), 0 4px 14px rgba(80, 50, 20, 0.25);
		}
		50% {
			box-shadow: 0 0 0 14px rgba(255, 210, 63, 0), 0 4px 14px rgba(80, 50, 20, 0.25);
		}
	}

	.ry-touch-btn.ry-down {
		transform: scale(0.92);
		background: #fff;
	}

	/* Jump and roll are twins: same size, same row. */
	#ry-btn-jump,
	#ry-btn-roll {
		bottom: calc(26px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
		width: 72px;
		height: 72px;
		font-size: 1.7rem;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	#ry-btn-jump {
		right: calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-right));
	}

	#ry-btn-roll {
		right: calc(110px + env(safe-area-inset-right));
	}

	#ry-btn-action {
		right: calc(40px + env(safe-area-inset-right));
		bottom: calc(112px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
		width: 76px;
		height: 76px;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		opacity: 0.3;
		transform: scale(0.85);
		transition: transform 0.15s, opacity 0.15s, background 0.15s;
	}

	#ry-btn-action.ry-on {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: scale(1);
		background: #ffd23f;
	}

	@media (pointer: coarse) {
		.ry-touch-btn {
			display: block;
		}
		#ry-objective {
			font-size: 0.8rem;
			padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem;
		}
		#ry-hint,
		.ry-desk {
			display: none !important;
		}
	}

	@media (pointer: fine) {
		.ry-mob {
			display: none;
		}
	}

	/* The game decides touch or mouse once; these win over the media queries. */
	.ry-root.ry-mouse .ry-mob,
	.ry-root.ry-touch .ry-desk {
		display: none !important;
	}

	.ry-root.ry-mouse .ry-desk,
	.ry-root.ry-touch .ry-mob {
		display: revert !important;
	}

	.ry-root.ry-mouse ul.ry-controls.ry-desk,
	.ry-root.ry-touch ul.ry-controls.ry-mob {
		display: flex !important;
	}

	#ry-dialog {
		position: absolute;
		left: 50%;
		bottom: calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		width: min(600px, calc(100% - 32px));
		box-sizing: border-box;
		padding: 1.3rem 1.2rem 0.9rem;
		border-radius: 1.1rem;
		background: #fffaf0;
		box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(80, 50, 20, 0.3);
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	@media (pointer: coarse) {
		#ry-dialog {
			width: min(560px, calc(100% - 260px));
			left: calc(50% - 40px);
			bottom: calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
			padding: 1.1rem 1rem 0.7rem;
		}
	}

	#ry-dlg-name {
		position: absolute;
		top: -0.8rem;
		left: 1rem;
		padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
